            <h3>Targeted progress, innovation entrepreneur catalyze equal opportunity.</h3>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section padding="0">
        <mj-column width="30%" vertical-align="middle">
          <mj-image
            fluid-on-mobile="true"
            src="https://ouch-cdn.icons8.com/thumb/581/a82bd962-a1ab-47e9-afcd-dbc95a37e051.png"
          >
          </mj-image>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="70%" vertical-align="middle">
          <mj-text mj-class="image-heading" align="left">
            <p class="date">Janurary 13, 2020</p>
            <h3>Targeted progress, innovation entrepreneur catalyze equal opportunity.</h3>
